OL,3,GNEWSAContinuing rise in home-schooling
OL,4,Abeing 'monitored'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council, like other local
OL,7,Fauthorities, has a duty to make sure
OL,8,Fchildren who are not in school are
OL,9,Fbeing properly educated elsewhere.
